        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "48 The Fairways, Rockshire Road, Waterford\r\n\r\nAn exceptional four-bedroom, three-bathroom, semi-detached home presented in excellent condition throughout, ideally positioned within the ever popular Fairways development in Ferrybank. This spacious and well-maintained home offers superb family accommodation complemented by a private rear garden, off street parking and a spacious secure block built workshop with electrical power.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys excellent kerb appeal with a generous driveway to the front and convenient side access leading to the private rear garden. To the rear, the garden offers a wonderful balance of patio and mature planting, creating a private and peaceful outdoor space.\r\n\r\nInternally, the home is bright, spacious and exceptionally well designed throughout. A welcoming entrance hall opens into a generous sitting room, complete with a gas fireplace and an attractive bay window that fills the space with natural light.\r\n\r\nA standout feature of the property is the second living room, enhanced by an overhead mezzanine level with Velux windows and a contemporary glass and stainless steel balustrade, creating a striking sense of space and light.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, a large open-plan kitchen, dining and living area forms the heart of the home, with sliding doors leading directly to the patio and garden. The kitchen is further complemented by a practical utility room with stacked washer and dryer, external door, along with smart built-in storage. A guest WC and ground-floor bedroom complete the accommodation at this level.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property offers an excellent family-friendly layout. The spacious principal bedroom features a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite bathroom, while two additional generously proportioned bedrooms, a family bathroom, the multi purpose mezzanine room off the landing with double aspect glazing and a landing storage closet, completing the first floor.\r\n\r\nHeating is gas fired with a C BER energy rating\r\n\r\nThis superb home offers spacious accommodation and a highly convenient location close to all amenities in Ferrybank, making it an ideal choice for buyers seeking a turnkey property in an established and mature residential setting. The property is a short walk to the new train and bus station, as well as the new footbridge, giving access to the heart of the city, opening up a choice of schools and connectivity.\r\n\r\nThese particulars do not constitute an offer or contract, and whilst every effort has been made in preparing all descriptions, dimensions, maps, and plans, these details should not be relied upon as fact. Dimensions / Illustrations are for guideline purposes only and not to scale. RE/MAX Property Specialists - Team fogarty will not hold itself responsible for any inaccuracies contained therein"
      },
